# $targetIsParam(pText) -> Boolean
# True when the TARGET FIELD carries THIS run's parameter, and is not a path
# left over from another one.
#
# Not a keyword test: a script that sets targetRef from a static path names its own target.
# Only 'targetRef' from $analyzeTarget means the field supplies the target; a path or '' does not.
# Computed from the text, never from cTargetPath: the field can hold a path left from another run.
Quit method $cinst.$analyzeTarget(pText)='targetRef'